    <div id="mainContent">
            <p class="Division"><a name="13.13.003"></a>Division 13-13-003<br />Fire Protection Water Supplies</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1313003.html#13.13.003">13-13-003</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Fire Protection Water Supplies</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1313003.html#13.13.003.0001">13-13-003-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Fire Hydrants</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1313003.html#13.13.003.0002">13-13-003-0002</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Fire Lines</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1313003.html#13.13.003.0003">13-13-003-0003</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Mains</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="13.13.003"><a name="13.13.003">13-13-003</a> Fire Protection Water Supplies</h3>
            <p class="P0">For fire protection water supplies refer to Section 507 of the International Fire Code. (Ord. 2017-22, Rep&amp;ReEn, 07/05/2017)</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="13.13.003.0001"><a name="13.13.003.0001">13-13-003-0001</a> Fire Hydrants</h3>
            <p class="P0">For fire hydrant construction specifications and design requirements refer to Section <a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1309006.html#13.09.006.0006">13-09-006-0006</a>. (Ord. 2017-22, Rep&amp;ReEn, 07/05/2017)</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="13.13.003.0002"><a name="13.13.003.0002">13-13-003-0002</a> Fire Lines</h3>
            <p class="P0">For fire line construction specifications and design requirements refer to Section <a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1309006.html#13.09.006.0006.4">13-09-006-0006.4</a>. (Ord. 2017-22, Rep&amp;ReEn, 07/05/2017)</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="13.13.003.0003"><a name="13.13.003.0003">13-13-003-0003</a> Mains</h3>
            <p class="P0">For water main construction specifications and design requirements refer to Division <a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1309003.html#13.09.003">13-09-003</a>. (Ord. 2017-22, Rep&amp;ReEn, 07/05/2017)</p>

